      "description": "Search any Google surface via CrustAPI and get clean, structured JSON. Choose the surface with `type`: web (organic results), maps (local businesses with ratings/phone/website), places (lean local pack), news, shopping, images, videos, scholar, patents, or autocomplete (query suggestions). Results come back in a stable, serper-compatible shape. One credit per successful result; empty results are free.",
